    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Analyze this API failure end-to-end using your available tools.\n\nService ID: {{$json.service_id}}\nService Name: {{$json.service_name}}\nEndpoint: {{$json.http_method}} {{$json.endpoint}}\nStatus Code: {{$json.status_code}}\nResponse Time (ms): {{$json.response_time_ms}}\nReported Severity: {{$json.severity}}\nReported Category: {{$json.category}}\nError: {{$json.error_message}}\nStack Trace: {{$json.stack_trace}}\nRequest Payload: {{$json.request_payload}}\nResponse Payload: {{$json.response_payload}}\nOccurred At: {{$json.created_at}}\n\nReturn ONLY the final JSON produced by the QA Reviewer Agent tool, unmodified.",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are the orchestrator for an API failure analysis pipeline. You do not analyze failures yourself — you delegate to specialist sub-agent tools and assemble their results. For every failure you MUST, in this exact order:\n1. Call the 'Triage Agent' tool with the raw failure fields (serviceId, serviceName, endpoint, httpMethod, statusCode, responseTimeMs, reportedSeverity, reportedCategory, errorMessage, createdAt).\n2. Call the 'Root Cause Agent' tool, passing errorMessage, stackTrace, requestPayload, responsePayload, endpoint, httpMethod, statusCode, and the full JSON string result from step 1 as triageAssessment.\n3. Call the 'Fix Engineer Agent' tool, passing the full JSON string result from step 2 as rootCauseAnalysis, plus endpoint and httpMethod.\n4. Call the 'QA Reviewer Agent' tool, passing the JSON string results from steps 1, 2 and 3 as triageAssessment, rootCauseAnalysis and proposedFix.\nIf any tool returns invalid JSON or an error, retry that tool once with clarified input before proceeding. Never skip a step and never call a later tool before its dependency has succeeded. Your final answer must be exactly the JSON object returned by the QA Reviewer Agent tool — no extra text, no markdown fences, no commentary."
        }
      },
      "id": "95dc7c1f-ca9f-469c-90d9-23a31b6150b7",
      "name": "Orchestrator Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
